window.products.push({"id":1169028,"name":"Panvola Tears Of My Physics Students Funny Physics Math Teacher Mug College Professor Graduation Appreciation Gift Coffee Cup (11 oz)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ThX0VFQ7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ultimate Gift Mug That Stands Out From the Rest: Give a gift that creates a lasting impression. Your teacher or co-teacher who is teaching physics can now enjoy their favorite coffee drinks and other beverages with this funny and hilarious mug designed to send smiles and love. Trust us, you'll not only want to get this for your family or friends but also for yourself if you believe you’re the best physics teacher ever. Premium Ceramic Coffee Mug: This high-quality 11oz ceramic white mug has a premium hard coat that provides crisp and vibrant color reproduction sure to last for years. Printed on both sides for either left or right-handed person so the awesome message and art will be visible. High-gloss and has a premium white finish that can make you enjoy your drink more. Can also be used as pen holders on your office work table, planter for your kitchen herb, jewelry holder, or serving your favorite dessert. Relatable Humorous Quote: Put a smile on your love ones’ faces with this mug with a funny quote. This drinking mug has a humorous relatable saying that can make any person smile when they read this. A stressful or hard day can also be fun with this drinkware on their dining, kitchen, or work table. A perfect conversation starter, and sure to amuse anyone. Hilarious and Quirky Gift: It's not just the functional aspects that make this mug stand out. Its humorous design is what makes it a truly special and memorable gift. Whether it's to celebrate birthdays, anniversaries, graduation, holidays, retirement, Christmas, or any special milestone that occurs in life, this mug is sure to bring a smile to their face and some laughter to their day. The perfect present for anyone who loves a good laugh! Dishwasher and Microwave Safe: These fantastic drinking mugs can go straight in the dishwasher, all day every day, meaning it can save you time, and be more hygienic. Perfect for your favorite hot or cold beverages. Easily reheat that coffee or tea you forgot to drink right away because it is microwave safe. Saves you time, is very convenient, and is perfect for your busy lifestyle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ThX0VFQ7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panvola","source_asin":"B0BQWNVCX1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169028","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQWNVCX1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQWNVCX1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
