window.products.push({"id":1169261,"name":"Datttcc 52 Pcs Glass Spice Jars,4oz Square Spice Containers with Golden Caps,Glass Spice Bottles with Labels,Chalk,Funnel for Spice Rack,Cabinet,Drawe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81k2OMDK2yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Complete spice jar set: 52 spice jars, 52 inner plugs, 52 gold metal caps, stickers and chalk, collapsible silicone funnel. All the accessories you need are in one package, no need to buy more, not only economical but also very practical. Premium quality: Our spice jars are made of lead-free thickened glass, strong and durable, with high transparency and crystal clear surface, you can see at a glance what the jar contains and how much is left. Dual function inner plug: Our spice jar has a stylish and unique 2-in-1 inner stopper with two spreading spouts, one for porous powdered spices and the other is a flip spout for herbs and grains. You have the flexibility to change the spreading spout to suit your needs. Labels&Funnel:There are 2 different styles of labels to help you better distinguish which spices are in the jar. The label contains the basic spice name and content, with a blank label for you to write your own spice name. Collapsible silicone funnels help you better fill the spices. Multifunctional: Our glass spice jars are sealed for storage to maximize freshness and extend storage time of spices. Not only can be used to store food such as seasonings, spices, salt, pepper, herbs, herbs, etc., but also used as party gifts, office supplies, crafts, decorative kitchen, DIY projects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81k2OMDK2yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Datttcc","source_asin":"B0B769BGCH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169261","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B769BGCH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B769BGCH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
