window.products.push({"id":1169266,"name":"Set of 2 - One Gallon Glass Beverage Dispensers with Spigot - 100% Leak Proof - Wide Mouth Easy Filling - Mason Jar Style Drink Dispenser For Outdoor,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pktgd9N4S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Entertain. Impress. Keep it chill. Be ultra-cool by letting guests help themselves to chilled drinks at parties, picnics, and dinners. The leak proof spigot ensures no mess is made, and the clamp tight lid protects drinks from flies and debris. A wide mouth allows you to infuse water with berries and fruits and makes hand washing a breeze. Durable and dishwasher safe, you can say hello to convenience and ease. SHIPS AS A TWO PIECE SET","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pktgd9N4S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LavoHome","source_asin":"B095FHCZRM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095FHCZRM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095FHCZRM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1169267,"name":"German Christmas Decoration Pyramid - 21 Inches - Wood Nativity Scene Set - Under the Christmas Tree and Table Top Holiday Decor - Nativity Play 3 Tie","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":77.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Igszt9JsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It is suggested that the Christmas pyramid is a predecessor of the Christmas tree. These pyramids are not limited to Christmas: in the Erzgebirge there was a custom of dancing around the \"St. John's Tree\", \"a pyramid decked with garlands and flowers\", at the summer solstice. Not actually pyramid-shaped, the Christmas pyramid is a kind of carousel with several levels, some depicting Christian motifs such as angels or manger scenes, and others with more secular motifs such as mountain-folk, forests, and other scenes from the everyday life of people in the Erzgebirge. The spinning motion of the pyramids is traditionally achieved with the help of candles whose rising heat spins a propeller above. Product Descriptions Dimensions: 21” x 10” (base) x 11” (top fan) In the Box: 1 x Christmas Pyramid 6 x Candle Holders 12 x Fan Blades 1 x Fan Blades holder 1 x Ceramic Nub 1 x Wood Nub Holder 1 x Manual & Instructions. **** IF ANY OF THESE PARTS ARE MISSING PLEASE CONTACT US IMMEDIATELY  VIA AMAZON SO WE CAN SEND IT TO YOU EXPEDITED****","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Igszt9JsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"USA SUPREME","source_asin":"B07JQ6JGNW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JQ6JGNW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JQ6JGNW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
