window.products.push({"id":1169290,"name":"Mundus Souvenirs You do What You can for as Long as You. Quote by Chuck Yeager, Laser Engraved on Wooden Plaque - Size: 8\"x10\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rY+-QMotL._AC_SL1048_.jpg","description":"\"You do what you can for as long as you can, and when you finally can't, you do the next best thing. You back up but you don't give up.\" quote by Chuck Yeager Motivation and inspiration are what gets us out of bed every morning. To give you that drive and touch of magic that you need in your life, why not add some wise words to your home or office today. With the finest thoughts of the greatest minds laser engraved into premium quality beechwood, the words that move you will decorate beautifully your home for years. Perfect for remembering what life is all about. A suitable gift for colleagues, friends and family. Also, it is a fantastic decoration item for shelves and tables. It can also be used as a wall hanging, to decor the plain walls; your choice of texts on these beautiful brown-hue wooden plaques. They carry a beautiful minimalist, antique style, that would not outdate so soon. *Please note that the display sample may not always be a true representation of the final wood product due to the very nature of the wood. Product image colours may vary due to the nature of the wood used and monitor display settings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rY+-QMotL._AC_SL1048_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mundus Souvenirs","source_asin":"B06XHY1QBN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169290","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XHY1QBN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XHY1QBN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1169291,"name":"The Kombucha Mamma Essential HEATING STRIP","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/319vUgIGDmL._AC_.jpg","description":"THE KOMBUCHA MAMMA ESSENTIAL HEAT STRIP - with MANUAL CONTROL - Move the unit closer or further away from the vessel to achieve the desired heating range. It is a common homebrewers refrain: \"How can I keep my Kombucha brew warm, especially in Spring, Fall and Winter?\" Until now, standard beer heating belts and weakly powered seedling mats were the only choices available. If you're house is cold, they won't help! The Kombucha Mamma Year Round Heating System w/Dimmer was designed by Kombucha Kamp with the help of a thermodynamics engineer. Designed for WARM TO MODERATE CLIMATES, the state of the art ultra-thin construction & patented heating technology makes for more uniform heat distribution. Wrap around one vessel or lay behind several vessels to keep them all warm. This is a powerful little mat but is also very safe to use. We recommend using it on the sides of the vessel rather than underneath so that the yeast isn't over stimulated. ***FEATURES: Warms the brewer area by about 5-20°F over ambient temperature to maintain the ideal temperature for Kombucha fermentation; Manual Control, move it closer or further from the vessel to control the heat produced; No heat wires or thick pad; Almost the entire surface of the mat is covered by the heat strips creating an even heat distribution; Moisture sealed electrical connections (Do not submerse in water); Ultra-thin Super durable construction; Heat Strip & power cord are UL Listed Components; 110-120V AC Power ; Uses 18 watts of power; Approximate Dimensions: 4\" Width x 24\" Length; Assembled in USA and all components made in the USA (except power cord) which means your friends and neighbors have a job!; Comes with 1 Year Hassle Free Guarantee!; FREE Thermometer Strip included; Works with any ferment! This package ships via USPS.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/319vUgIGDmL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kombucha Kamp","source_asin":"B008OHZ1C8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169291","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008OHZ1C8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008OHZ1C8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
