window.products.push({"id":1169300,"name":"LANOMY Laundry Bags Extra Large Washable Dirty Clothes Organizer with Drawstring Closure Durable for Travel Camp Dark Blue,40inch L× 30inch W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HDnGr7XOL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"EXTRA LARGE CAPACITY: Our laundry bags extra large heavy duty is the best solution for organizing your laundry. It measures 40inch × 30inch (102cm*75cm), which is much TALLER & BIGGER than normal size. This size is big enough for holding 3~4 loads of laundry for each, making it ideal for travel, storage in college dorm or family use. TRAVEL LAUNDRY BAG & DURABLE: The heavy duty laundry bags are made of high-quality nylon, lightweight but durable and machine washable. MULTIFUNCTIONAL USE: Our Extra Large Laundry Bags are suitable for hampers, baskets, sorters. Bags also can storage dirty clothes, sleeping bags, towels, pillows etc. Great choice for sleep away summer camp, easily folded flat for future use. MACHINE WASHABLE: The travel laundry bag is Machine Washable rather than by hand which will save your time and promotes reuse. WITH DRAWSTRING CLOSURE & Perfect Gift: With drawstring closure, you can stay assured your belongings won’t spill out of the bag. It's easy for carry. It’s a perfect gift for your family on Christmas, Thanksgiving, birthdays, or just because to makes life easier.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HDnGr7XOL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LANOMY","source_asin":"B09D7CS7KV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169300","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D7CS7KV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D7CS7KV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1169301,"name":"Tribello 20 OZ Overnight Oats Container With Lid, Set of 4 Crunch Cups To Go, Portable Parfait Cup With Compartments for Topping Cereal Or Oatmeal - C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-xisMQQOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for a convenient travel cereal bowl and milk container to start meal-prepping healthy breakfasts? Are lunch salads more your thing? Or perhaps you'd just like to make ahead some precut fruit cups to snack on during your busy day? Tribello oatmeal container to go can help with all of that! We designed this to go cereal and milk container to fit various needs while still being compact and easy-to-use!Tribello Cereal Containers With Lids And Spoons:- Come in a set of 4 yogurt containers, making them great for meal prep, so you can just grab a cup and go;- Come in 4 colors: red, yellow, green & white;- Have leakproof safety covers;- Have separate dome compartments to keep cereal & granola fresh and separated from milk or yogurt;- Come with 4 spoons;- Have a wide-mouth opening for easy filling and cleaning;- Are made of drop-resistant BPA free high-quality plastic material;- Are dishwasher, freezer & microwave safe (hello warm oatmeal at work)!Tribello cereal to go cup with spoon is also great for healthy homemade breakfasts like yogurt parfaits & granola or muesli with fresh fruit. Just pour the yogurt or milk in the large cup, screw on the lid, put your dry ingredients or fruit in the separate dome storage compartment, and screw it on top of the cup. Your healthy breakfast is ready, and the cereal won't get soggy! Breakfast on the go cups can also be used as pre-made salad containers or to go fruit cups.Portable & reusable breakfast cereal containers are meant to make your life easier, and healthy eating more convenient. Business professionals, travelers, students, body builders & dieters love our to go oatmeal cups. Join the movement and enjoy fresh food at work, school, sports events, on excursions and camping trips!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-xisMQQOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tribello","source_asin":"B09P3244N6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169301","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P3244N6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P3244N6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
