window.products.push({"id":1169319,"name":"Drill Free 3 in 1 Wall Mounted Soap Dispenser with Highly Adhesive Glue - iZiv Manual Shower Soap Dispenser, Modern Shampoo Pump Dispenser for Home&Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lNEjJajoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NO-DRILL WALL MOUNT DESIGN & MULTIPLE INSTALLATION METHODS - iZiv 3 in 1 shower pump dispenser, easy to install. With screws or silicone glue in the product to install it on the wall.(note: clean the wall before installation, and wait 72 hours before adding liquid. Sturdy and durable, no more drilling into your beautiful bathroom tiles!) It can also be removed without leaving behind any sticky residue. RUST-PROOF MATERIALS & ECO-FRIENDLY - Made of Environmental ABS plastic, sturdy and durable. Heat resistant, not easily deformed, no bacterial, anti corrosion, healthy and sanitary to use. It's smooth and sleek design makes it a stylish and practical addition to any bathroom, and its durable construction ensures that it will last for years to come. LARGE CAPACITY & ERGONOMIC - Carry with 350ml(11.8oz) big mouth refillable bottle which can be took out from the soap dispenser, easy to adding liquid. The bottom of bath soap dispenser is equipped with an outlet liquid nozzle for separation, which can effectively guide the direction of liquid outflow. The transparent window design, you will know amount clearly and replenish liquid in time, allows user to check the capacity easily. STURDINESS & MULTIFUNCTION - The push-type working principle makes commercial soap dispenser very easy to control the amount of liquid dispensed, can avoid leakage and waste. More suds, less clutter, eliminate bottle clutter and keep shampoo and soap easily accessible. Special for liquid goods, like hand sanitizer, facial cleanser, dish soap, face wash, men shaving cream, body wash, shampoo, etc. WIDE RANGE OF USE - Classic style, fashionable style, adopt advanced technology coated, smooth and shiny surface, never fade and easy to scrub and clean. Ideal use in bathrooms, kitchens, kindergartens, offices building, RV camps, tiny houses, schools, hospitals, airports, hotels, restaurants, banks, public restrooms and many other high-end places.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lNEjJajoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iZiv","source_asin":"B0C3QW8R5T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169319","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3QW8R5T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3QW8R5T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
