window.products.push({"id":1169347,"name":"Ecowood Costa Rica Teak Wood Cutting Board For Kitchen. Luxury 1 Single Wood Slab, No Glue, Rustic Natural Live Edge. Size XXL (14.5x12 inches)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MfiWdVtZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Handmade with love in the costarican forest, natural teak wood cutting board treated with organic coconut oil, perfect for culinary application in kitchen or restaurants, or as serving tray in your table, ONE SOLID PIECE:it never crack or bend like bamboo or other cutting boards / chopping blocks made of more than one piece of wood glued together, What gives teak it’s uniquae strenght and impermeability is a combination of natural wood oils, tight wood grain and tensile strength. Whereas even other hardwoods such as acacia, maple and walnut need to have oils applied to keep water out, teak is one (if not the only) wood that retains it’s natural oils even after being processed, thats why is used in sailboats and outdoor furniture. This are the reasons why this amazons top quality cutting board is a must in your kitchen or restaurant. All our products are sourced from sustainable and environmental friendly teak plantations, Every cutting board is unique and different than the other ones because nature is the designer and nature never run out of ideas. We recommend to treat the cutting board with organic coconut oil couple times a year to highlight the colors and beauty of this exotic wood.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MfiWdVtZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ecowood Costa Rica","source_asin":"B0829HPR7H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169347","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0829HPR7H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0829HPR7H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1169348,"name":"Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner, 50pcs Airfryer Parchment Paper Sheets Round with 100pcs Disposable Gloves, Oil-proof, Water-proof, Non-stick Food Gr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xxaSSvD6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍟【High Quality】Our air fryer liners is made of high-quality food grade parchment paper. Oil-resistant, waterproof, non-sticking, withstands high temperature.Maintains the integrity and beauty of the food, and retains the flavor of the food. Let you more enjoyment.(When you use air fryer paper in the air fryer, please try to brush a layer of grease on the inner wall of the paper, and the food should be larger than 2/3 of the area of the air fryer paper to prevent the air fryer paper from burning) 🍕【Anti-Stick】This parchment paper sheets prevent food from sticking to the fryer. Effectively isolates greased paper stains, extending fryer life and reducing cleaning time. If you hate the cleaning issues that come with baking, this is the perfect accessory for you. 🍗【Easy to Use】Whether you're baking or frying or otherwise cooking, air fryer disposable paper liners don't require any extra work. Just take out a piece of parchment, load the food, put it in the air fryer, set the time, and wait for it to ripen. If you want the food to be more flavorful, pause the machine, turn the food over, and continue. 🥩【Wide Applications】It is very important to use the right air fryer liner. This parchment paper wheel has a base diameter of 7.9 inches and a height of 1.77 inches, and air fryer accessories come in capacities from 5 to 8 quarts. Our baking paper is not only suitable for air fryers, but also for microwaves, ovens, pans, steamers, toasters and more. 🍤【Product Tips】When you have preheated the machine, place food in the disposable air fryer liner before placing it in the air fryer or other cooking machine. so as not to burn directly into the paper lining of the air fryer basket. 50pcs Airfryer Parchment Paper Sheets Round(7.9 in) plus 100pcs PE Disposable Gloves. 🤝【SAVIYA.Ga promise】: If you have any questions about our air fryer paper, please feel free to contact us. Our customer service team is always at your service to provide you with a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xxaSSvD6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAVIYA.Ga","source_asin":"B09ZRQ94MF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169348","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZRQ94MF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZRQ94MF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1169349,"name":"String of Turtles Peperomia Prostrata, Vining Plant, Live Tiny Mini Pixie Plant, 2 inch Pot by BubbleBlooms","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514yUDkIgTL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"[EXPERTLY PACKAGED] We package and wrap each plant individually with the utmost care. We are very accommodating and receptive. Feel free to message for any issues or requests. [HEALTY GUARANTEE] House plants are always healthy and gorgeous and it won't be hard to keep them that way. Our stellar team will help fix any plant issue. [TINY & GIFTABLE] Super tiny and cute plant in a 2 inch pot. All plants are individually wrapped and is a great gift for any plant lover [EASY TO GROW] All our plants prefer to be in a bright shade (i.e.: not direct sunlight). They grow amazingly indoors and outdoors. The plants are also very low maintenance. [MORE TO SEE] Check the BubbleBlooms store to see all these types of plants and more like carnivorous, hoyas, and other wildly unique house plants.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514yUDkIgTL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BubbleBlooms","source_asin":"B09RHF8J17","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169349","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RHF8J17","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RHF8J17","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
