window.products.push({"id":1169421,"name":"Heavy Duty Kitchen Shears by Ascendant--Includes Seafood Scissors - - Heavy Duty ULTRA Sharp Surgical Stainless Steel-- Multipurpose Utility Shears-A ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MnYckZrkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This is a double set of kitchen utility shears. Both are heavy duty razor sharp stainless steel shears. They can cut most anything that you require. The shears can be used for poultry, meat, vegetables and fish. They are perfect while grilling or at the barbeque. They can cut through a rib rack without any trouble. The larger shear can be used to scale a fish. The smaller curved shear can be used to devein and peel shrimp—a few snips and the shrimp is deveined and shell falls right off.These shears can remove a bottle cap as well as crush nutshells. They can also be used to twist of a stubborn twist off cap. As a vegetable cutter they can dice herbs, scallions, peppers and chop lettuce for a perfect chopped salad.They are perfect for trimming cut flowers --even those difficult rose and sunflower stems. They are great in helping cut the shapes and pictures for your children's school projects. Indeed, the curved scissors make difficult cutting a breeze. Once these shears are in your kitchen drawer, you will often reach for them everyday to open boxes or plastic packaging. These shears cut right through the rigid plastic packaging that accompanies so many products—avoid the dangerous use of a knife when opening the plastic packaging with these safe and sharp shears. We are so confident that you will love these shears that we offer a 90 day-no questions asked- money back guaranty and a lifetime replacement. They are dishwasher safe. They will provide years of service. We think that these shears are the PERFECT KITCHEN TOOL!!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MnYckZrkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ascendant","source_asin":"B07TH9RGT7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169421","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TH9RGT7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TH9RGT7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
