window.products.push({"id":1169436,"name":"Yunaeduo Microfiber Beach Towels for Adults - Quick Dry Lightweight Beach Towel - Oversized Beach Towel (31.5”x63”) Super Absorbent - Large Sand Free ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Oir4NG2XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ENJOY THE SUN AND WAVES - When you head to the beach, having a beach towel that is lightweight, sand-proof, and quick dry will enhance your vacation experience. Our microfiber beach towel is designed to meet these needs. We offer a variety of styles for you to share with friends and family. With our towels, enjoy a wonderful holiday together. EASY TO CARRY - Unlike traditional fluffy towels, our lightweight beach towel is compact and takes up minimal space in your beach bag. It can be folded to save up to 70% of the space, leaving more room for other beach essentials. Microfiber beach towels are taking the world by storm and replacing cotton towels. SAND FREE BEACH TOWEL - Nobody wants to bring a bunch of sand to the car or home after a day at the beach. That’s why our large beach towel is perfect for your beach vacation. Our oversized beach towels are made of microfiber fabric, featuring a soft and smooth texture that prevents sand from sticking to the towel. After using it at the seaside, you can easily and quickly shake the sand off, enjoy a more comfortable holiday life. ABSORBENT & QUICK DRY - Our Dock and Bay Beach Towel is highly absorbent and will quickly dry off the water. The weaving craftsmanship of adult beach towels is delicate, resulting in a thin yet dense texture. These towels also have a significant windproof effect, warm and comfortable when wrapped around the body. The microfiber beach towels for adults dry faster than cotton towels and do not develop an unpleasant odor when damp. NO-FADE & MULTIPLE USAGE - Our beach towels oversized are made using the latest digital printing technology, ensuring that their colors remain bright and vibrant even after repeated washings. In addition, these towels are essential accessories for all your vacation, travel, camping, swimming, and yoga needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Oir4NG2XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yunaeduo","source_asin":"B0C2NB9HZN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169436","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2NB9HZN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2NB9HZN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
