window.products.push({"id":1169453,"name":"GloBoid Wood Charger Plates & Trays, Wooden Tray For Food & Decor, Wooden Serving Board & Platter, 10’ x 10' Wood Tray & Serving Platters, Acacia Wood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810WlKYCozL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Shaahn Woodworks are proud to present these gorgeous wooden plates, made from only the finest sustainably sourced Acacia tree.  With its deep brown color and attractive natural grain, it gives a warm, rich touch to any home. These beautifully crafted plates are perfect for hosting any party or event and are guaranteed to catch the attention and impress guests due to their unique design and luxurious quality. You don’t have to wait until Thanksgiving or Christmas to show them off, they are also ideal for serving a Spring picnic, Summer BBQ, or a spur of the moment cheese spread. These plates are suitable for any and all food types, appetizers, entrees or desert, there’s nothing that these plates aren’t perfect for.  Each plate also comes in deluxe gift box packaging, making it the ideal gift for any occasion from weddings to anniversaries and birthdays to Christmas, put a smile on a loved ones face by gifting them these wooden wonders.  Acacia's durability means it isn't scratched easily, while its water-resistant properties means it won't warp readily and is highly resistant to staining meaning it’s also perfect to use for home décor.  To keep our plates looking their best for longer along with making them more heat and stain resistant than competitors, they are gently coated with food grade varnish giving them that high quality and classy finished look.  We wholly stand by our products and therefore if you’re not entirely happy with the plates or their quality, neither are we. We offer a full ‘no questions’ asked refund policy, along with a 12-month guarantee . If anything isn’t as you expected, we will do whatever we can to make it right, with our U.K. based customer care team. Shaahn Woodworks are a subsidiary of GloBoid brands, for any queries please get in touch with our dedicated customer care team at contact@globoidco.com","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810WlKYCozL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GloBoid","source_asin":"B08TVT516B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169453","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TVT516B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TVT516B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1169454,"name":"Innovative Porter Traverse Rod - 66-120","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":60.06,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MIq0eiJzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Innovative Traverse Rod Series is designed to be an elegant and fuss-free addition to your windows. Pre-attached clips ensure that opening and closing your curtains are one smooth glide away! Works great with pinch pleat or rod pocket curtains.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MIq0eiJzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Achim Home Furnishings","source_asin":"B0BCRC1N93","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169454","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCRC1N93","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCRC1N93","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1169455,"name":"Tenrry Cedar Blocks, 30 pcs Cedar Blocks for Clothes Storage, 20 Cedar Sticks, 10 Cedar Cubes, Cedar Blocks for Storage, Cedar for Clothes Storage, Ce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812C7bByRnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Cedar Blocks, Protect Clothes.】Our cedar blocks (20 cedar sticks & 10 cedar cubes) are made of aromatic American eastern red cedar wood. The raw material is only cut into pieces and then sanded to be smooth. In cedar blocks you find no pungent smells, they do wonders to protect your clothes in storage but nothing to impact your health. 【Lasting Cedar Aroma.】Cedar blocks for storage protects clothes in storage against damages committed by annoying little dwellers in wardrobe closets because of its aroma coming form cedar oils in the wood. As a woody smell, it's not overwhelming, you may only smell it when you put cedar blocks near your nose, but it's effective at keeping clothes intact. To guarantee lasting aroma, we only use fresh cedar wood rich in cedar oils. 【Cedar for Clothes Storage.】Have you been frustrated to find your garments in storage ruined by little creatures in closets? Cedar blocks for closets and drawers are the perfect solution to this headache. Meanwhile, cedar wood absorbs damp air to keep your clothes dry. Another extra benefit is the fresh aroma that makes your clothes smell like you just walk from the woods. 【Crafted from Fresh Cedar Wood.】On the surface of cedar blocks, you may find white powder like salt. Don't panic! They are nothing but cedar oils crystals. Our cedar blocks are crafted from fresh cedar wood rich in cedar oils, which slowly but continuously come to the surface and crystallize. The crystallization has no impact on the effectiveness of cedar blocks, but you can wipe off the crystals by a tissue or cloth if you mind. 【Multiple Uses, Easy to Use.】Cedar blocks for clothes storage can be used throughout your sweet home. Besides closets and drawers, they can also be put in pantries, kitchen cupboards, vehicles, storage bags or boxes, shoe cabinets, bookcases or anywhere else you like. Just scatter them randomly in drawers or put them in between clothes, fill them in mesh bags and attach the bags to hangers, put some pieces in shoes to deodorize and keep shoes dry…they are always easy to use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812C7bByRnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tenrry","source_asin":"B09KRSFTHP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169455","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KRSFTHP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KRSFTHP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
