window.products.push({"id":1169647,"name":"GROSCHE Oasis 22 oz. - 650 ml Double Walled Stainless Steel Water Infusion Bottle, Vacuum Insulated Infuser Water Bottle for Fruit Infused Water, with","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G8V+6quXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The GROSCHE Oasis is a truly unique Infusion water bottle. Not only is it a well buit stainless steel vacuum insulated thermos flask, bit it also has a very easy to open lid that also makes it leakproof. It also includes a strainer for making fruit infused water. Just add in your fruit, and pop in the strainer, and keep adding water throughout your day to keep it infused to make antioxodant water easily. Its perfect for yoga, the gym, the office, outdoors, camping or hiking, etc. It is also durable and strong, and made to the highest specifications in the industry as compared to any other water flask brand. It has a capacity of 22 oz / 650 ml and it also fits in a cup holder for most standard vehicles. It has a triple layer insulation that keeps your drink cold for upto 24 hrs or hot upto 12 hrs. The bottles are made to a very high quality with double layer 18.8 stainless steel with another layer of copper insulation (similar to Hydro Flask or Yeti) and come with a limited lifetime warranty. As if all that werent enough, the bottles have another totally unique feature beyond being the best stainless steel infuser bottles. Each bottle also provides 50+ days of safe water to people in need via the GROSCHE Safe Water project. Each bottle is laser etched with a GROSCHE project code. When you enter the code that is on your bottle into the URl that is etched on your water bottle, you can meet the actual family that your bottle has helped to fund. Also every time you share a photo of your bottle on social media using the hashtag #myoasisgiveswater we will provide one extra day of safe water on your behalf via the GROSCHE safe water project. The Oasis infuser stainless steel water infusion flask - bottle is a unique gift that gives back forever as long as you keep sharing the #myoasisgiveswater through social media. In that way, this gift that gives back also connects you to the change you make in other peoples lives and the actual family that your bottle helped to sponsor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G8V+6quXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GROSCHE","source_asin":"B07X1LZRYC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169647","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07X1LZRYC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07X1LZRYC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
