window.products.push({"id":1169668,"name":"45pcs Cake and Cookie Baking Supplies,Christmas Decorations of 28 Icing Piping Tips,1 Non-Stick Baking Mat,12 Cookies Cutters,2 Embossing Rolling Pins","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u2BxAZTtL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"It is a rich Set for Christmas gift baking supplisies, You will have everything to create Christmas cakes and cookies for you and kids. This set is tested by two bakers, practical and good results. Kit Includes: ♥ 28 Pieces Christmas Icing Piping Nozzles Tips. Christmas cake decorating tips are very popular among bakers. total of 28 pieces, including snowflakes, Christmas trees, Santa Claus, flowers Rose heart Angel wings and 5 pieces alphabet etc., for Christmas and Valentine's day cake decoration. Size: 1.6x1.5x0.9in Material: 18/8 stainless steel♥ 1 Piece of Christmas Exclusive Baking Mat. Christmas Design, made of premium silicone and glass fiber. It is non-sticky,anti-slip,safe,soft,durable and will not wrinkle or fade.It can also be used as a daily baking mat,kids will ove it. Size: 23.6x15.7inch(60X40cm).♥ 2 pieces Embossing Rolling Pins. We believe in our products! When you use the traditional roller rolling pin, if you use too much force, you will face the resistance of the dough, if you force is too small, you can not get the perfect embossing pattern.So we confidently improved it! It's compact, light and easy to use.you just need to force evenly on the rolling pin,the depth of the pattern is controlled by yourself. Pattern: Reindeers and snowflakes. Size: Total L=11.2inch,Pattern L=7.8inch, D=1.1inch. Material: Quality Wooden (Beech). Please Brush the cooking oil before use so that the dough will not stick to the rolling pin. It can be used as a baking supplies for kids. ♥ 12 Pieces Stainless Steel Cookie Cutter Used for Christmas cookie make. The patterns are Santa Claus, Reindeer, Christmas Tree, Snowman, Bell, Cane, Boots, Candy, Stars, Heart, Crown, etc. Use with the rolling pin and you will get a perfect Christmas.Suitable for kids. Size: From 1.7inch to 3.4inch, Height 1.0 inch. Material: 430 stainless steel. Thicken and Surface polishing. ♥ 2 Pieces Accessories of TP","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u2BxAZTtL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KIVISIN","source_asin":"B07YY4KLTZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169668","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YY4KLTZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YY4KLTZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
