window.products.push({"id":1169686,"name":"Large Air Fryer Silicone Liners - 8” Colorful Food Grade Reusable Air Fryer Liners Fit Trays up to 5 QT - BPA Free Airfryer Liners Silicone Withstand ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61udItjk4gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you love air frying foods but hate having to use expensive parchment paper or non-stick spray each time, these air fryer reusable liners will be your new best friend! They’ll help you “fry” up tasty foods for the family, like mozzarella sticks, tater tots, french fries, and chicken nuggets/tenders, without all the guilt and extra calories. Plus, our silicone air fryer filters are designed with raised indentations to elevate the food inside the air fryer slightly. The result? The foods inside won’t be exposed to the grease that drips down, so they’ll be crispy and crunchy all over. Do you still need more convincing? Below are 5 more reasons why these airfryer liners will be a welcomed addition to your kitchen. Pack of 3 colorful reusable liners – gray, blue & pink Made from food-grade, non-stick silicone without BPA High heat resistance (up to 446 degrees Fahrenheit) Suitable for the microwave, oven, stove & dishwasher Useable in both round & square air fryers up to 5 quarts At Kertia Kitchen, we’re all about creating products that help inspire at-home chefs. Ultimately, we want to help people of all ages enjoy cooking delicious, nutritious meals at home so they spend less on takeout and going out to restaurants. We think that you’ll find cooking at home can be a fun, therapeutic, and satis-frying (sorry, we had to do it) experience that brings families closer together. So, are you ready to take your air frying skills to the next level and really impress your family and friends? If the answer is YES, grab these silicone air fryer liners!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61udItjk4gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kertia Kitchen","source_asin":"B0BJ1JQ686","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169686","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ1JQ686","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ1JQ686","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
