window.products.push({"id":1169704,"name":"Old World Christmas Hanging Tree Ornament, White Mixer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FeoTFSwGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The mixer was introduced in 1856 by Ralph Collier. In 1908 the electrical mixer was born. Before the mixer, baking was much more laborious and time consuming, slowing production. Now bakers can produce pounds of dough as fast as they can be consumed. Old World Christmas is the premier brand of Christmas ornaments in the country. The founders, Tim and Beth Merck, a couple who shared a special love for Christmas, are credited with revitalizing the art of mouth-blown fine glass ornaments as a result of their reintroducing figural designs to the United States in 1979. Each figural glass ornament produced by Old World Christmas is hand crafted in age-old tradition using the same techniques that originated in the 1800's. Molten glass is mouth-blown into finely carved molds made exclusively for Old World Christmas, before a hot solution of liquid silver is poured inside. The ornaments are then hand-painted and glittered to achieve the beautiful creations. At Old World Christmas our goal is to offer the best in quality, design, and value. We promise to provide high-quality, traditionally designed, hand-crafted ornaments that are created with even more attention to detail than those produced 100 years ago. We are committed to excellent customer service, affordable prices, and fast, efficient shipping that is second-to-none. Package contains (1) Old World Christmas Hanging Tree Ornament, White Mixer. Size: 3 1/4 inches. Mouth blown into carved mold. Hand-painted and glittered in a series of labor-intensive steps to achieve the beautiful creations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FeoTFSwGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Old World Christmas","source_asin":"B07FMCFFK9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169704","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FMCFFK9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FMCFFK9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1169705,"name":"ELEVARIFY Professional Blender for Kitchen Quiet: Vacuum Commercial Blender for Shakes and Smoothies - 56oz Industrial Countertop Blenders - 1500W Hig","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":359.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H-tnH98QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍒Multifunctional Vacuum Blender: The Elevarify kitchen blender adopts the innovative vacuum technology, the oxygen is totally removed from the smoothie blender jar before blending, creating a smoother, more colorful mixture that keeps fresh longer and is healthier than regular blenders. With this professional blender, you can easily make juices, shake, ice, smoothies, baby food, hot soups, frozen desserts, dips, and more. PS: The non-vacuum function is also available by using non-vacuum lid. 🍒Strong Power Juicer: The food processor blender is equipped with military-grade 4-bladed laser stainless steel blades, super sharp and sturdy to handle the toughest ingredients. With a 2.5 horsepower high-end motor, the high speed blender reaches a speed of up to 35000RPM, can break the cell walls instantly, fully releasing the nutrients and giving you a more delicate taste. The quiet blender comes with a thicken professional soundproof cover(6mm), can effectively reduce 40% of noise. 🍒Intuitive Controls: The vacuum blender comes with 6 presets (Ice,Frozen,Fresh,Nuts,Soup,Clean) and 10 speeds controls, allowing you to refine every texture of culinary with precision in minutes! The pulse feature provides quick bursts of power, making it easy to create chunky textures. The digital LED display makes the food preparation time clear. With the efficient self-cleaning mode, just add a drop of dish soap and warm water, the food blender easily cleans up and thoroughly within 30s. 🍒Multiple Safety Protections: The thicken mixing jar(5mm) is made of Eastman Tritan Copolyester TX1001 material, BPA-free, not easy to burst. The kitchen blender will work only when the cup cover is installed in place; when the cup body is lifted or cover is opened, the countertop blender will stop working; the built-in radial cooling fan works automatically as the professional blender works to avoid overheated; the cooking blender will automatically power off when the motor is overheated. 🍒Commercial Heavy Duty Blender : The 64-ounce container is ideal for restaurant or a family of 6-8. We have been focusing on providing high-quality blenders and the best customer service, we provide a 3-year warranty, if you have any questions while using the kitchen blender, please feel free to contact us. PS: A blender cookbook with 50 recipes is included, come and join us, unlocking your healthy lifestyle!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H-tnH98QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ELEVARIFY","source_asin":"B0C8D957YM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169705","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C8D957YM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C8D957YM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1169706,"name":"10 Gram Aluminum Indicating Silica Gel Canister 3 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814QG+Z1wnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our compact aluminum canister is full of Orange Indicating Silica Gel that adsorbs moisture in closed environments. With our 10 gram canister, you’ll be able to place it in spaces that are up to .75 cubic units per feet, which makes it optimal for gun storage, ammo storage, toolboxes, and other enclosed areas where humidity is an issue. This is a 3 pack. The top of the unit contains a built-in clear window to see the status of the indicating beads. When the silica gel is an orange color, that means it’s dry and ready to adsorb moisture. As it adsorbs moisture, the color will gradually change from orange and turn into a dark green color. These canisters are cordless, rechargeable, and can easily reactivate in the oven for multiple reuses. Silica Gel inside the canisters are reusable and versatile for many items like keeping electronics dry, in storage bins, in camera bags, and more. Silica Gel desiccant is a non-toxic, non-flammable, and chemically inactive drying agent that adsorbs forty percent of its weight in moisture. Every single gel bead contains millions of surface pores that magically soak up water vapor. Our Dry-Packs Silica Gel Desiccant do not contain Cobalt Chloride (II) (Indicating Silica Gel that is blue in color has been linked as a possible carcinogenic to humans) and we offer a safer and equally effective alternative. To reactivate, follow the instructions located on the canister. Dimensions of each canister: 2\" x 1\" x 1/2\". The coverage area per unit is: .75 cubic units per feet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814QG+Z1wnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fairly Odd Treasures","source_asin":"B00BL77NEW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169706","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BL77NEW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BL77NEW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
