window.products.push({"id":1169752,"name":"Rechargeable Salt or Pepper Grinder,NisuAM Gravity Automatic Pepper Mill with White LED light, One Handed Operation Spice Grinder ，Upgraded Salt Grind","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FapbndTPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【USB RECHARGEABLE】Charging with the type-C cable, without extra batteries, save much money for you.It can support 200 uses with a single fully charged for ultra-long standby time.USB rechargeable, convenient and fast, you can use it anytime, anywhere. This electric pepper mill is the good helper for kitchen, restaurant, party and outdoor picnic. 【GRAVITY SENSOR + SAFETY SWITCH】The auto pepper grinder works by gravity sensor.Just flip the grinder and it starts working, when it comes back, it stop. If falls down, it will not be grinding as you switch off the safety switch to prevent self-starting.One-handed operation makes cooking more convenient. 【WHITE LED LIGHT】The LED light will automatically light up when it is working, clearly illuminating the food. Compared to other blue/yellow LED lights,white light can accurately judge the size of the amount. 【AUTO DUST LIDS】We noticed that most customers hope the top of the pepper grinder has a cover to prevent the dust and dirt. NisuAM electric pepper mill grinder just solve this problem.It's auto-opening and closing lids,so convenient to use. 【ADJUSTABLE COARSENESS】The top of pepper grinder refillable can be rotated to set your desired coarseness, from fine to coarse.Great for sea salt, black pepper, white pepper and other spices. 【VISUALIZED RESERVES + REFILLABLE】Our gravity salt or pepper grinder is designed with side-opening refillable transparent silo to visualize storage capacity.The maximum capacity of the pepper mill is 100ml, which is double the capacity of other grinders. 【EASY TO CLEAN】Comes with a small brush for easily cleaning the grinder.It is convenient for the brush to reach inside to clean up. These rechargeable electric salt and pepper grinders make cooking a breeze.It's a great gift choice for birthday Thanksgiving Christmas and New Year.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FapbndTPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NisuAM","source_asin":"B0BB7CPTSF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169752","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB7CPTSF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB7CPTSF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
