window.products.push({"id":1169809,"name":"3 Pcs Sunflower Gifts Farmhouse Wall Decor Thankful Grateful Blessed Wooden Signs Lemon Hanging Wall Signs Rustic Sunflower Kitchen Decor for Farmhous","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717Rh4OjjiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features:  Add charm and beauty: The fine workmanship and simple appearance of these wooden lemon decors make them ideal for everyday home furnishings. You can hang them where you want, either together or separately, depending on your preferences or ideas. Simple and rustic wooden signs hanging plaques can add charm and beauty to your space.  Size detail: The size of each wood sign is approx. 12 x 4 x 0.3 inches, and there are metal hooks on the back of each board, which can be combined freely. The appropriate size allows you to hang it anywhere you want, such as kitchen, living room, bathroom, etc., the rustic style can match various interior decoration styles.  Easy to hang: There are 2 hooks on the back of the wooden sign wall decor, so you can hang it on the wall, door or fireplace directly, easy and convenient, time and effort saving.  Specifications: Main material: wood Color: as pictures shown Size: approx. 12 x 4 x 0.3 inches  Package includes: 3 x Thankful grateful blessed wooden signs  Note: Manual measurement, please allow slight errors on size. The color may exist slight difference due to different screen display. The words printed on our products are for decorative purpose only, not applied as trademark, our trademark is Yalikop.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717Rh4OjjiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yalikop","source_asin":"B09TT37WK6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169809","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TT37WK6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TT37WK6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1169810,"name":"Kobi Blocks Maple Edge Grain Butcher Block Wood Cutting Board 18\"X26\"X1\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R+N9IL+DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Upgrade your kitchen by adding a custom made Butcher Block Cutting Board. Easily one of our most popular blocks, you can’t go wrong with this old world styling and rustic charm. The block truly brings out the beauty in simplicity. Manufacturing Process All the wood used is purchased from a local mill here in the Smoky Mountains. All Tennessee Butcher Blocks are manufactured with precision machinery using all natural products to balance making your board unique, while maintaining the highest standards in each step of our planeing, ripping, adhesion, measuring, cutting, sanding and oiling processes. We are a husband and wife team and we make each order as they come in, ensuring that every board is fresh cut and newly crafted just for you! Design We strive to bring an artistic quality to every board we make so your piece can seamlessly fit in as a contemporary, yet rustic, homey and warm piece of décor when not in use. Is there a special occasion coming up in your life? Tennessee Butcher Blocks make the perfect gift for Mother’s or Father’s day, Valentine’s Day, Birthdays, Anniversaries, Weddings, Christmas, Hanukkah, Housewarming gifts and many other traditional occasions. Other sites can take weeks to get your board out; whereas we can get it to you in days! Since our boards are made from all natural healthy wood products, and not from chemically plagued plastic products, Tennessee Butcher Blocks require minimal, but needed maintenance to help keep your board in good condition. Our maintenance guide comes complimentary with every piece. Our Promise We stand behind our products and make every board to last a lifetime with proper maintenance for each and every Tennessee Butcher Block we sell, in hopes that your Block will be a part of your family and home for generations. Best of all; ALL Tennessee Butcher Blocks are 100% MADE IN THE USA!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R+N9IL+DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kobi Blocks","source_asin":"B00LB00VMU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169810","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LB00VMU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LB00VMU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
