window.products.push({"id":1169903,"name":"Luciano Gourmet 13.75\" Kitchen Spatula – Nylon Solid Turner Spatula, Multiple Functions, Heat Resistant Cooking Spatula – Ergonomic Handle, Nonstick S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31xTdNQgLAS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Nylon Solid Turner – Protecting the Surfaces of Nonstick Pans Nonstick pans are one of the blessings in this era; with all the rush out there, cooking has also become a hassle as everybody wants to cook fast with a delicious result. Cooking in nonstick cookware meets the demands, but when these nonstick pan surfaces get damaged due to stirring and food turning with steel and other kitchen tools, it becomes worrisome. Do not fret and buy Luciano Gourmet solid spatulas for cooking! These kitchen spatulas made with the finest quality nylon material is perfect for all kinds of nonstick cookware. It will not damage the surfaces or cause any scratches on the cookware; hence you can easily flip and turn food and slide underneath different foods with our turner spatula without any worry. Heat Resistant Spatula – Comfortable Handle and Dishwasher Safe Our cooking spatula is made to resist high temperature so that cooking on high flames does not destroy the spatula or damage it. The nylon spatula can bear temperature as high as 400Degree F with deforming, and its long handle keeps the spatula out of the pan. The handle is also ergonomic and does not slide or skid away from the hand, so with its firm grip; you do not have to worry about it slipping. Black large spatula can be easily washed with soapy water as nylon material does not stick to food. Our nonstick spatula is also safe to be cleaned in a dishwasher when you need to save time and have the dishes and utensils cleaned in a short time. Product Specifications Brand Name: Luciano Gourmet Material: Nylon Color: Black","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31xTdNQgLAS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luciano Gourmet","source_asin":"B0921V47W6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1169903","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0921V47W6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0921V47W6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
